menu "Metal Gear Solid (mgs_reversing + psyz)"

    config MGS_ENGINE
        bool "Build the Metal Gear Solid native port"
        default y
        help
            Compile the decompiled game (components/mgs/mgs_reversing) against
            psyz's PlayStation SDK reimplementation and software GPU, with the
            Tab5 platform layer in components/mgs/src.

    config MGS_START_STAGE
        string "Stage to boot into"
        default "title"
        help
            "title" runs the real boot chain (title screen, opening cutscene,
            then the dock), as retail does. To jump straight into a stage:
            s00a is the dock, s01a the heliport, s02a the tank hangar; any name
            in port/stage_union.c's Mgs_PlayableStages works (a demo stage,
            dXXX, plays its cutscene).

endmenu
